{
  "bodyHash": "FQubIiNfSvI=",
  "content": "<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>重要！！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>我目前正在重製這個模組，進行一些改動，例如護甲功能的調整，修復所有錯誤，並不時添加玩家要求的內容。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>同時也將加入滅卻師和人類（完現術者）種族。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>注意！！</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>在使用「死神徽章」之前，請確保沒有穿著任何護甲，因為它會將護甲欄位中的所有護甲替換為死霸裝。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>特色：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>種族</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>死神</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>扮演死神時，你將獲得</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>死神徽章</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，死神徽章內含你的死霸裝和斬魄刀。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>你將從低階死神的斬魄刀</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>淺打</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>開始。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>你必須收集</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>特定類型的靈魂</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>來</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>喚醒</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>你的斬魄刀。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>收集50個靈魂後，你的斬魄刀將會覺醒。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>覺醒時，它會根據你收集的特定靈魂類型，隨機選擇你的斬魄刀。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>虛</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span>扮演虛時，你將以低階虛的身份出現在虛圈。 </span></span></span><span><span><span>生存並消滅其他虛，以便進化到更高階的虛。你可以進化為</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>基利安，</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> 然後 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>亞丘卡斯</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>（若不吞噬靈魂會退化回基利安），然後 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>瓦史托德。</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>達到瓦史托德後，你可以使用</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>崩玉</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> 進化到下一個階級 </span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>破面。</span></span></span></span></strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span><span><span>假面軍勢</span></span></span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span>要成為假面軍勢，玩家必須先解鎖始解。 </span></span></span><span><span><span>然後玩家需要擁有</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>50個虛的靈魂</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span> + 收集</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>100個靈魂類型</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>（力量、速度、控制...），然後使用</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>崩玉</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。 </span></span></span><span><span><span>靈魂類型將決定你獲得哪種</span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span>假面面具</span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span>。 </span></span></span><span><span><span>所有面具都會提供抗性增益，但每種類型會賦予不同的效果。</span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span><span><span>假面類型與增益：</span></span></span></span></em></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>力量假面：</span></span></span></span></em><em><span><span><span><span>抗性與力量</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>速度假面：抗性與速度</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>控制假面：抗性與再生</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>颶風假面：抗性與加速</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>火焰假面：抗性與火焰抗性</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>劇毒假面：抗性與毒素免疫</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>冰霜假面：抗性與冰凍免疫</span></span></span></span></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span><span><span>暗影假面：抗性與虛弱、挖掘疲勞、失明和凋零效果的免疫</span></span></span></span><br></em></li>\n<li><em><span><span>光明假面：抗性、夜視與失明免疫。</span></span></em></li>\n<li><strong><em><span><span>注意：玩家若獲得斬月，則無法使用假面，因為其已自帶面具。</span></span></em></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span>備註：</span></span></strong><span><span> 要啟動面具，請按下 </span></span><strong><span><span>面具開啟</span></span></strong><span><span> 快捷鍵(M)，關閉則按 </span></span><strong><span><span>蹲下 + 面具開啟</span></span></strong><span><span> 快捷鍵(M)。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span>斬魄刀</span></span></strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span><span>死神：</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 護斬丸（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 蛇尾丸（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 野晒（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 風死（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 神槍（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 斬月（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 千本櫻（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 肉雫唼（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 侘助（始解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 流刃若火（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 雷火（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 疋殺地藏（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em><span><span>- 雀蜂（始解與卍解）</span></span></em></p>\n<p><em>- 冰輪丸（始解、卍解與真卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 白雪（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 斷風（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 嚴靈丸（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 花天狂骨（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 一文字（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 紅姬（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 金沙羅（始解與卍解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 鏡花水月（始解）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 更多敬請期待...</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>虛：</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 雙兒響轉（歸刃）</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 黑翼大魔（歸刃）</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 聖母慈悲（歸刃）<br>- 殘酷（歸刃與二次解放）</strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 更多敬請期待...</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>生物：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<em>所有虛均為自訂虛（部分外觀類似動畫/漫畫）：</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em>- 力量型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 力量型亞丘卡斯</em></p>\n<p><em>- 力量型瓦史托德</em></p>\n<p><em>- 速度型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 速度型亞丘卡斯</em></p>\n<p><em>- 速度型瓦史托德</em></p>\n<p><em>- 控制型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 控制型亞丘卡斯</em></p>\n<p><em>- 控制型瓦史托德</em></p>\n<p><em>- 火焰型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 劇毒型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 冰霜型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 颶風型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 暗影型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 光明型虛</em></p>\n<p><em>- 所有斬魄刀（目前可用的）的刀靈 + 卯之花八千流。</em></p>\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em><em>- 浦原喜助（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 二枚屋王悅</em></p>\n<p><em>- 淺打生物</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>技能：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>死神：</strong></p>\n<p><em>- 破道之一「衝」（造成傷害並擊退）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 破道之三十一「赤火炮」（造成傷害）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 破道之三十二「黃火閃」（造成傷害）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 破道之五十八「闐嵐」（造成傷害並擊退）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 破道之八十八「飛龍擊賊震天雷炮」（造成傷害）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 破道之九十「黑棺」（造成傷害）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 縛道之四「這繩」（束縛）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 縛道之二十一「赤煙遁」（煙霧彈）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 縛道之三十九「圓閘扇」（護盾）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<em>- 瞬步</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>虛：</strong></p>\n<p><em>- 虛閃</em></p>\n<p><em>- 虛彈</em></p>\n<p><em>- 黑腔</em></p>\n<p><em>- 再生</em></p>\n<p><em>- 響轉</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>隊長：</strong></p>\n<p><em>- 一番隊隊長山本（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 二番隊隊長碎蜂（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 六番隊隊長白哉（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 十一番隊隊長劍八（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 三番隊隊長鳳橋（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p><em>- 四番隊隊長卯之花（NPC與Boss）</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>指令：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>set_zanpakuto_type_to (類型)  {<strong>Hozukimaru, Nozarashi, Zabimaru, Zangetsu, Shinso, Kazeshini, Senbonzakura, Minazuki, Wabisuke, Ryujin, Raika, Ashisogi, Suzumebachi, Hyorinmaru, Shirayuki, Tachikaze, Gonryomaru, KatenKyokotsu, Ichimonji, Benihime, Kinshara, KyokaSuigetsu</strong>}</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>set_hollow_type (類型) {<strong>LosLobos, Pantera, SantaTeresa, Murcielago</strong></em><em>}</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>player_exp (數值)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>set_player_reishi (數值)</em></li>\n<li><em>unlock_bankai (true/false)</em></li>\n<li><em>unlock_resurrection (true/false)</em></li>\n<li><em>melee_sfx (true/false)</em></li>\n<li><em>bankai_sfx (true/false)</em></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>解鎖與裝備技能：</strong></p>\n<p><em>當你達到特定等級時，你將解鎖技能。要裝備技能，你有3個欄位可以裝備技能，切換欄位後選擇你想裝備的技能。<strong>瞬步</strong>有專屬欄位裝備。</em></p>\n<p><em>&nbsp;</em></p>\n<p><strong>快捷鍵：</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>P：玩家選單</p>\n<p>K：技能選單</p>\n<p>R：切換斬魄刀技能</p>\n<p>Z：移動技能</p>\n<p>X：欄位技能 1</p>\n<p>C：欄位技能 2</p>\n<p>V：欄位技能 3</p>\n<p>H：空中漫步</p>\n<p>M：面具啟動</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>解鎖空中漫步</strong>（飛行）<strong>：</strong></p><p><em>作為<strong>死神</strong>，你需要擁有超過5000點<strong>靈壓</strong>才能解鎖<strong>空中行走</strong>，使用時先<strong>跳躍</strong>，再按下<strong>按鍵綁定</strong>。而作為<strong>虛</strong>，你必須先成為<strong>破面</strong>。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>解鎖卍解與歸刃：</strong>&nbsp;</p><p><em>當你覺醒你的<strong>斬魄刀</strong>時，你也會解鎖它的<strong>始解</strong>型態。要解鎖<strong>卍解</strong>，你需要先達到30級，然後你將獲得召喚<strong>轉神體</strong>的物品，它會召喚你的斬魄刀之魂。擊敗斬魄刀之魂即可。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em>而作為<strong>虛</strong>，要解鎖<strong>歸刃</strong>，你需要使用<strong>轉神體</strong>召喚虛之魂，擊敗它們即可解鎖歸刃。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>解鎖破面</strong></p><p><em>要解鎖破面，你需要先達到瓦史托德等級，然後吞噬50個死神靈魂，最後使用崩玉。</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>關閉始解、卍解與歸刃：</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><span><span>你可以在手持武器時使用</span></span><strong><span><span>潛行 + 右鍵</span></span></strong><span><span>來退出始解、卍解和歸刃，同時保持死神或破面型態。</span><span>如果你在卍解狀態下靈壓耗盡，你將會退出死神型態。</span></span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span><span>如何解鎖隊長職位：</span></span></strong></p><p><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>你需先解鎖卍解，並擁有超過2000點靈壓，你還需要</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>地獄蝶</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>，你可以合成它。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>然後去找浦原喜助交談，他會送你前往屍魂界。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em><br><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>在屍魂界中，你可以找到隊長們的據點，與他們戰鬥以獲得他們的徽章，從而成為隊長。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em><br><em><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>注意：如果你解鎖了隊長職位但仍處於死神型態，請退出死神型態並再次使用死神徽章，它將會裝備成隊長羽織。</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<strong><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>Discord：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong></p><p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/aNJEg4WmMz\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span>https://discord.gg/aNJEg4WmMz</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></a></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
